  {
   "id": "n339",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "IT Designer",
   "x": -100,
   "y": 6915,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "n340",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 Manage user accounts\n(create, update, delete)\n\u2022 Manage roles & permissions\n\u2022 Handle support requests\n\u2022 View audit logs & security\n\u2022 Manage document types\n\u2022 View reconciliation data\n\u2022 Configure AI validation refs",
   "x": -80,
   "y": 6945,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 210
  },
  {
   "id": "n341",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Admin Manager",
   "x": 240,
   "y": 6915,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "n342",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 All PM overrides\n\u2022 Archive projects (Admin only)\n\u2022 Manage workflow templates\n\u2022 Override PM approvals\n(needs 10+ char reason)\n\u2022 View all dashboards/logs\n\u2022 Approval hierarchy config\n\u2022 Security settings",
   "x": 260,
   "y": 6945,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 210
  },
  {
   "id": "n343",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Owner",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 6915,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "n344",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 View all dashboards\n(read-only)\n\u2022 Approve purge & legal hold\n\u2022 Owner portfolio view\n\u2022 Owner approval of proposals\n\u2022 Account recovery for\nIT Designer",
   "x": 600,
   "y": 6945,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 210
  },
  {
   "id": "n345",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Automated Jobs",
   "x": 920,
   "y": 6915,
   "width": 280,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n346",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "\u2022 8 advisory signal rules\n(see table below)\n\u2022 Attendance exception\ndetection\n\u2022 Overdue task notifications\n\u2022 Design request sweep",
   "x": 940,
   "y": 6945,
   "width": 240,
   "height": 210
  },
  {
   "id": "n347",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**8 Advisory Decision-Support Signals**\n\n1. Cost variance \u2014 actual vs planned budget\n2. Cumulative change impact \u2014 total COs as % of contract\n3. Burn vs progress \u2014 money spent vs % complete\n4. Issue recurrence \u2014 same issue category repeating\n5. Stalled stage \u2014 workflow stuck past threshold\n6. Projected finish \u2014 estimate vs deadline\n7. Overdue tasks \u2014 past due date\n8. Milestone slip \u2014 behind estimated date",
   "x": -100,
   "y": 7235,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 260,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "n348",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "Role Action Summary",
   "x": -100,
   "y": 7535,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 420,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "n349",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Owner** \u2014 read-only all; approves purge/legal hold\n\n**Admin** \u2014 overrides, archive, templates, PO above limit\n\n**IT Designer** \u2014 users, roles, audit logs, support\n\n**Project Manager** \u2014 projects, milestones, phase advance,\nRFI routing\n\n**HR** \u2014 payroll batches, employee records, attendance\n\n**Finance Manager** \u2014 budgets, POs, payments, payroll approval\n\n**Architect** \u2014 proposals, designs, blueprints, RFI answers\n\n**Engineer** \u2014 requirements, PRs, tasks, issues, inspections\n\n**Consultant** \u2014 design/proposal review, RFI remarks\n\n**Site Personnel** \u2014 task status, DTR, daily reports, deliveries\n\n**DCO** \u2014 RFI logs, transmittals, logbook entries",
   "x": -80,
   "y": 7565,
   "width": 580,
   "height": 380
  },
  {
   "id": "n350",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Legend**\n\n\ud83d\udfe2 Green \u2014 normal action step\n\ud83d\udd35 Blue \u2014 terminal / outcome / report\n\ud83d\udfe3 Purple \u2014 entry / archived / summary\n\ud83d\udfe1 Yellow \u2014 flow start / cross-cutting group\n\ud83d\udfe0 Orange \u2014 decision point / on hold\n\ud83d\udd34 Red \u2014 cancelled / blocking / destructive\n\nFull written step-by-step:\n[[14 System Flowchart]]\n\nThis canvas: every user action,\ndecision branch and gate across\nall 10 roles and 5 main flows.",
   "x": -500,
   "y": -2000,
   "width": 320,
   "height": 420,
   "color": "6"
  }
 ],
